WEBVTT

00:11:59.476 --> 00:12:01.156
what do you want to see?

00:12:02.076 --> 00:12:06.316
Will you have chosen despair, denial,

00:12:06.316 --> 00:12:07.996
or something different?

00:12:08.916 --> 00:12:13.236
Will you have been a spectator
to our planet's problems

00:12:13.236 --> 00:12:16.636
or the person who did
something to fix them?

00:12:17.916 --> 00:12:19.596
What will your story be?